  "description": "Requires network access to the free BrewPage hosting service (brewpage.app); no account, API key or payment; uses bash, curl, Node.js and Python 3 for the bundled runner. Prepares local drafts with zero network calls, publishes supplied content or a newly composed page (HTML, Markdown, JSON, files, built static sites, forms that save visitor answers) and returns an HTTPS link, and updates a specific existing BrewPage publication in place; keeps owner keys in a local receipt file.",
